%% Same node/edge contract as decision-flow.svg.
flowchart TD
    CONTRACT["1. Select laboratory source and mapped fields<br/>Laboratory: code/system + name + specimen/method + value/statistics + unit/system + references<br/>One pipeline.toml selects sources from catalog.csv; downloads stay under local/<br/>Preflight checks roles, types, paths, count semantics, source/profile editions and configured services"]
    FHIR["2. Full FHIR validation selected?<br/>Complete resource export → local validator + pinned profile → separate OperationOutcome<br/>Then use the same semantic adapter for scalar or native FHIR data"]
    GROUP["3. Aggregate the complete semantic set<br/>distinct: individual CSV / FHIR / DB values → n, mean, sample SD / SE, min / max, median / IQR<br/>Pool supplied disjoint summaries; keep reference context. Optional items mode serves A1 inspection."]
    A1["4. A1: check source meaning, then cross-field plausibility<br/>Exact code/system and unit evidence → name/axes/specimen fit → code–unit compatibility<br/>Check finite values, reference order/context and supported whole-set transformations<br/>Optional Laya: record domain/unit-system/next-step hints; keep original checks and declared source"]
    A2["5a. Optional A2: lookup proposals<br/>Grouped A1 report → candidates/pages → local model<br/>Verify selected code/name/unit against actual terminology<br/>Record proposal, sources and unresolved context"]
    A3["5b. Optional A3: study evidence<br/>Grouped A1 report → screened Europe PMC / PubMed<br/>Local extraction → exact quote/analyte/number/unit guards<br/>Retain statistic, interval, context and source"]
    REVIEW["6. Review the complete set<br/>Field table: source → finding/condition → recommendation + why → status and sources<br/>Scope results: profile QC / identity / quantity / code–unit fit / whole set + evidence<br/>Clinician approves / rejects / defers; source data is retained<br/>Reuse compatible approved laboratory mappings after rechecking targets and factors"]
    CONTRACT --> FHIR
    FHIR --> GROUP
    GROUP --> A1
    A1 -.-> |"lookup"| A2
    A1 -.-> |"studies"| A3
    A1 --> |"A1 review"| REVIEW
    A2 --> REVIEW
    A3 --> REVIEW
    classDef normal fill:#f3f7fa,stroke:#c4d5df,color:#142d42
    class CONTRACT,FHIR,GROUP,A2,A3 normal
    classDef teal fill:#eef7f4,stroke:#a8cfc6,color:#142d42
    class A1,REVIEW teal
    classDef error fill:#fcf1f3,stroke:#ecc7cf,color:#142d42
